TECHNOLOGY REQUIREMENTS

Must use ONLY:

expo ~53.0.11
react 19.0.0
react-native 0.79.6
expo-router ~5.1.0
nativewind 4.1.23
zustand ^5.0.11
react-native-reanimated ~3.17.4
react-native-gesture-handler ~2.24.0
react-native-safe-area-context 5.4.0
